3. Build: Selectors:

	- id → JavaScript targeting / anchoring only
		* Use for: getElementById, fragment links (#section). Do not use for styling
	- class → visual styling
		→ layout grouping
		* Don't use for JS logic or state
	- name → passing value to backend
		* Don't use for JS or styling
	- title → user-facing descriptive tooltip text only
		* Don't use for hidden data storage or selection hooks
	- type → intrinsic element behavior definition only
		*Don't use for styling variants or JS branching
	- value → form/input value only
		*Do NOT use for: storing app data or selection
	- href → navigation target only
		*Do NOT use for: JS routing flags or behavior triggers
		(avoid href="#" + JS logic as primary mechanism)
	
